{"4773290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LAKE STILLWATER", "steam_appid": 4773290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/8f551ca1646d12167b6f21e809f65d36.poster.avif?t=1785344454\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/8f551ca1646d12167b6f21e809f65d36.webm?t=1785344454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/8f551ca1646d12167b6f21e809f65d36.mp4?t=1785344454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You keep returning to the same woodland over and over again, but why? Something that you can't quite remember holds you captive in this cozy, mystery adventure.<br><br>In this RPG, you follow Lily, a girl relentless on tracking a missing person in Lake Stillwater after receiving a peculiar note left upon her doorstep. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Leaving the confines of her bedroom she brings a camera with otherworldly features she doesn't quite remember the origins of in hopes to capture evidence and clues to find the person missing. Explore atmospheric hand-drawn pixelated environments, solve  puzzles, collect notes, encounter strange creatures, and piece together the mystery as to what drives Lily's obsession with Lake Stillwater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ Featuring ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ </strong>Unique point-and-click, Side-Scroller/RPG combined gameplay <strong>◆</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ </strong>A journal log to keep track of the evidence you find <strong>◆</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ </strong>A mysterious camera, used to manipulate the environment, solve puzzles, and defend yourself <strong>◆</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ </strong>Multiple narrative routes influenced by player choices <strong>◆</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ </strong>Discover hidden notes, photographs, and secret recordings that reveal the truth behind Lake Stillwater <strong>◆</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ </strong>Original soundtrack blending atmospheric electronic with cinematic elements <strong>◆</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ </strong>Stylized pixel art environments and characters with majestical atmospheric effects <strong>◆</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ </strong>Hand drawn and animated cutscenes in a moving comic-book style <strong>◆</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ Wield a peculiar camera ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/f8ebd41d27cce3ba14f57d8beee7ce0e.poster.avif?t=1785344454\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/f8ebd41d27cce3ba14f57d8beee7ce0e.webm?t=1785344454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/f8ebd41d27cce3ba14f57d8beee7ce0e.mp4?t=1785344454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your camera is your sole arsenal, use it to uncover secret passages, bend your environment and maybe even use it defensively.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ Find your way through the bramble ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/8e166a72eeeae31d5ce0b4efe72a0064.poster.avif?t=1785344454\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/8e166a72eeeae31d5ce0b4efe72a0064.webm?t=1785344454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/8e166a72eeeae31d5ce0b4efe72a0064.mp4?t=1785344454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The undergrowth has begun to reclaim the woodland within Lake Stillwater, passages and footpaths have become blocked by the hostile vegetation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>◆ Explore the woodlands of Lake Stillwater ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/cc773e441492e85d54e86b133224c85b.poster.avif?t=1785344454\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/cc773e441492e85d54e86b133224c85b.webm?t=1785344454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773290/extras/cc773e441492e85d54e86b133224c85b.mp4?t=1785344454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Peculiar notes have been scattered across the woodland, what do they mean? and who wrote them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text